# Fresh process on the same isolated sealed profile. The authored Cards and
# accepted history reopen exactly, while run state belongs only to the prior
# process's device epoch and starts stopped here.
settle 90
ui-zoom 1
assert snap practice-saved == true
assert snap practice-save-problem == false
assert snap set-cards == 3
assert snap rehearsal-running == false
assert snap p5clock-paused == false
assert snap p5clock-history-count == 6
assert snap p5clock-status == stopped
act p5clock-verify-reopen
capture 01_exact_sealed_clock_reopen
log P5 shared device-clock fresh-process reopen complete
